Absolutely — here is a more professional DJ LUCXY website with a black/red neon style, animated equalizer, music player, mixtape cards, download buttons, and a responsive mobile menu.
I’ve made it as a single index.html file so it’s easy to test. You only need to add your own music and cover images.
Writing
DJ LUCXY — Professional Music Website
Save the following as index.html:
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>DJ LUCXY | Official Website</title>

    <meta
        name="description"
        content="Official website of DJ LUCXY. Listen to songs, mixtapes and download the latest music."
    >

    <style>

        /* =========================
           RESET
        ========================== */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #050505;
            color: #fff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }


        /* =========================
           VARIABLES
        ========================== */

        :root {
            --red: #ff003c;
            --red-light: #ff174f;
            --dark: #050505;
            --card: #111111;
            --gray: #999;
            --border: rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.25);
        }


        /* =========================
           SCROLLBAR
        ========================== */

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #050505;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--red);
            border-radius: 20px;
        }


        /* =========================
           HEADER
        ========================== */

        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 75px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;

            padding: 0 7%;

            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);

            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);

            z-index: 9999;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--red);
            text-shadow:
                0 0 5px var(--red),
                0 0 20px var(--red);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        nav a {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--red);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--red);
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            font-size: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--red);
        }


        /* =========================
           HERO
        ========================== */

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            text-align: center;

            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;

            padding: 120px 20px 80px;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 50% 40%,
                    rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.22),
                    transparent 35%
                ),
                #050505;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";

            position: absolute;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: var(--red);

            filter: blur(180px);

            opacity: 0.12;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;

            max-width: 900px;
        }

        .hero-small {
            color: var(--red);

            letter-spacing: 5px;

            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(65px, 13vw, 150px);

            line-height: 0.9;

            font-weight: 900;

            letter-spacing: -5px;

            text-shadow:
                0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.3);
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--red);

            text-shadow:
                0 0 10px var(--red),
                0 0 30px var(--red),
                0 0 70px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.7);
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 600px;

            margin: 30px auto;

            color: #bbb;

            font-size: 18px;

            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            gap: 15px;

            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 15px 30px;

            border-radius: 5px;

            font-weight: bold;

            transition: 0.3s;

            border: 1px solid var(--red);
        }

        .btn-red {
            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-red:hover {
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 30px var(--red);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;

            color: white;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 25px var(--red);
        }


        /* =========================
           EQUALIZER
        ========================== */

        .equalizer {
            position: absolute;

            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;

            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            align-items: end;

            gap: 5px;

            opacity: 0.35;

            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .bar {
            width: 7px;

            height: 30px;

            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 10px var(--red);

            animation:
                equalize 0.7s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: .1s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: .2s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(4) {
            animation-delay: .3s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(5) {
            animation-delay: .4s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(6) {
            animation-delay: .5s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(7) {
            animation-delay: .6s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(8) {
            animation-delay: .2s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(9) {
            animation-delay: .4s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(10) {
            animation-delay: .1s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(11) {
            animation-delay: .5s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(12) {
            animation-delay: .3s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(13) {
            animation-delay: .6s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(14) {
            animation-delay: .2s;
        }

        .bar:nth-child(15) {
            animation-delay: .4s;
        }

        @keyframes equalize {
            from {
                height: 15px;
            }

            to {
                height: 130px;
            }
        }


        /* =========================
           SECTION
        ========================== */

        .section {
            padding: 110px 7%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;

            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .section-title span {
            display: block;

            color: var(--red);

            font-size: 12px;

            letter-spacing: 4px;

            margin-bottom: 12px;

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 45px;
        }


        /* =========================
           MUSIC PLAYER
        ========================== */

        .player {
            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;

            gap: 30px;

            padding: 30px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #151515,
                    #090909
                );

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: 15px;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.08);
        }

        .player-cover {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1;

            border-radius: 10px;

            overflow: hidden;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #ff003c,
                    #25000c
                );

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            font-size: 70px;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.25);
        }

        .player-cover img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;

            object-fit: cover;

            display: none;
        }

        .player-info {
            display: flex;

            flex-direction: column;

            justify-content: center;
        }

        .now-playing {
            color: var(--red);

            font-size: 12px;

            letter-spacing: 3px;

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .player-info h3 {
            font-size: 35px;

            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .player-info p {
            color: var(--gray);

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        audio {
            width: 100%;

            accent-color: var(--red);
        }

        .player-download {
            display: inline-block;

            margin-top: 20px;

            padding: 13px 20px;

            background: var(--red);

            text-align: center;

            border-radius: 5px;

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .player-download:hover {
            background: white;

            color: var(--red);
        }


        /* =========================
           MIXTAPES
        ========================== */

        .dark-section {
            background: #090909;
        }

        .mixtape-grid {
            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));

            gap: 25px;
        }

        .mixtape {
            background: #111;

            border: 1px solid #222;

            border-radius: 12px;

            overflow: hidden;

            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .mixtape:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);

            border-color: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 15px 50px rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.15);
        }

        .mixtape-cover {
            height: 280px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #ff003c,
                    #20000a
                );

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            font-size: 65px;

            position: relative;
        }

        .mixtape-cover img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;

            object-fit: cover;

            display: none;
        }

        .mixtape-number {
            position: absolute;

            top: 15px;
            left: 15px;

            background: rgba(0,0,0,.7);

            padding: 7px 12px;

            border-radius: 20px;

            font-size: 12px;

            color: #fff;
        }

        .mixtape-info {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .mixtape-info h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .mixtape-info p {
            color: #888;

            font-size: 14px;

            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .download {
            display: block;

            text-align: center;

            background: var(--red);

            padding: 12px;

            border-radius: 5px;

            font-weight: bold;

            transition: .3s;
        }

        .download:hover {
            background: white;

            color: var(--red);
        }


        /* =========================
           SONGS
        ========================== */

        .song-list {
            max-width: 950px;

            margin: auto;
        }

        .song {
            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr auto;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 20px;

            padding: 18px;

            margin-bottom: 10px;

            background: #111;

            border: 1px solid #1d1d1d;

            border-radius: 8px;

            transition: .3s;
        }

        .song:hover {
            border-color: var(--red);

            background: #151515;
        }

        .song-number {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: #1d1d1d;

            color: var(--red);

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .song h4 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .song p {
            color: #777;

            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .song audio {
            margin-top: 8px;

            max-width: 400px;
        }

        .song-download {
            padding: 10px 15px;

            border: 1px solid var(--red);

            color: var(--red);

            border-radius: 5px;

            font-size: 13px;

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .song-download:hover {
            background: var(--red);

            color: white;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 60, .4);
        }


        /* =========================
           ABOUT
        ========================== */

        .about {
            max-width: 850px;

            margin: auto;

            text-align: center;
        }

        .about p {
            color: #aaa;

            font-size: 18px;

            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        /* =========================
           SOCIAL
        ========================== */

        .social {
            text-align: center;

            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        .social a {
            display: inline-block;

            margin: 7px;

            padding: 12px 20px;

            border: 1px solid #333;

            border-radius: 5px;

            color: #aaa;

            transition: .3s;
        }

        .social a:hover {
            color: white;

            border-color: var(--red);

            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 60, .3);
        }


        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================== */

        footer {
            padding: 50px 20px;

            text-align: center;

            border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c;

            color: #666;
        }

        footer strong {
            color: var(--red);
        }


        /* =========================
           MOBILE
        ========================== */

        @media (max-width: 768px) {

            header {
                padding: 0 5%;
            }

            .menu-btn {
                display: block;
            }

            nav {
                position: absolute;

                top: 75px;
                left: 0;

                width: 100%;

                display: none;

                flex-direction: column;

                gap: 0;

                background: rgba(5,5,5,.98);

                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            }

            nav.active {
                display: flex;
            }

            nav a {
                padding: 18px 25px;

                border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                letter-spacing: -3px;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 80px 5%;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 35px;
            }

            .player {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

                padding: 20px;
            }

            .player-cover {
                max-width: 280px;

                margin: auto;
            }

            .player-info h3 {
                font-size: 27px;
            }

            .song {
                grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr;
            }

            .song-download {
                grid-column: 2;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .song audio {
                max-width: 100%;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- =========================
     HEADER
========================== -->

<header>

    <a href="#home" class="logo">
        DJ <span>LUCXY</span>
    </a>

    <div class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleMenu()">
        ☰
    </div>

    <nav id="nav">

        <a href="#home" onclick="closeMenu()">Home</a>

        <a href="#music" onclick="closeMenu()">Music</a>

        <a href="#mixtapes" onclick="closeMenu()">Mixtapes</a>

        <a href="#about" onclick="closeMenu()">About</a>

    </nav>

</header>



<!-- =========================
     HERO
========================== -->

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="hero-small">
            OFFICIAL WEBSITE
        </div>

        <h1>
            DJ <span>LUCXY</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
            Feel the sound. Experience the energy.
            Listen to the latest songs, mixes and mixtapes
            from DJ LUCXY.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">

            <a href="#music" class="btn btn-red">
                ▶ LISTEN NOW
            </a>

            <a href="#mixtapes" class="btn btn-outline">
                DOWNLOAD MIXTAPES
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- ANIMATED EQUALIZER -->

    <div class="equalizer">

        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>
        <div class="bar"></div>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =========================
     FEATURED MUSIC
========================== -->

<section class="section" id="music">

    <div class="section-title">

        <span>NOW PLAYING</span>

        <h2>Featured Music</h2>

    </div>


    <div class="player">

        <div class="player-cover">

            <!--
            TO USE YOUR OWN COVER:
            1. Put your image in the images folder.
            2. Change the src below.
            3. Change display:none to display:block.
            -->

            🎧

            <!--
            <img src="images/featured.jpg" alt="DJ LUCXY">
            -->

        </div>


        <div class="player-info">

            <span class="now-playing">
                DJ LUCXY • LATEST RELEASE
            </span>

            <h3>
                My Latest Song
            </h3>

            <p>
                Listen to the latest release from DJ LUCXY.
            </p>


            <!--
            IMPORTANT:
            Put your actual MP3 file in:
            music/latest-song.mp3
            -->

            <audio controls>

                <source
                    src="music/latest-song.mp3"
                    type="audio/mpeg">

                Your browser does not support audio.

            </audio>


            <a
                class="player-download"
                href="music/latest-song.mp3"
                download="DJ-LUCXY-Latest-Song.mp3">

                ⬇ DOWNLOAD SONG

            </a>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =========================
     MIXTAPES
========================== -->

<section class="section dark-section" id="mixtapes">

    <div class="section-title">

        <span>DJ LUCXY PRESENTS</span>

        <h2>Latest Mixtapes</h2>

    </div>


    <div class="mixtape-grid">


        <!-- MIXTAPE 1 -->

        <div class="mixtape">

            <div class="mixtape-cover">

                🎵

                <!--
                Replace the emoji with your cover:

                <img
                    src="images/mixtape-1.jpg"
                    alt="DJ LUCXY Mixtape 1">
                -->

                <div class="mixtape-number">
                    MIXTAPE 01
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="mixtape-info">

                <h3>
                    DJ LUCXY MIXTAPE VOL. 1
                </h3>

                <p>
                    The first official DJ LUCXY mixtape.
                    Turn up the volume and enjoy.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="download"
                    href="music/mixtape-1.mp3"
                    download="DJ-LUCXY-Mixtape-Vol-1.mp3">

                    ⬇ DOWNLOAD

                </a>

            </div>

        </div>



        <!-- MIXTAPE 2 -->

        <div class="mixtape">

            <div class="mixtape-cover">

                🔥

                <div class="mixtape-number">
                    MIXTAPE 02
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="mixtape-info">

                <h3>
                    DJ LUCXY MIXTAPE VOL. 2
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Another high-energy mix packed
                    with your favourite sounds.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="download"
                    href="music/mixtape-2.mp3"
                    download="DJ-LUCXY-Mixtape-Vol-2.mp3">

                    ⬇ DOWNLOAD

                </a>

            </div>

        </div>



        <!-- MIXTAPE 3 -->

        <div class="mixtape">

            <div class="mixtape-cover">

                🎧

                <div class="mixtape-number">
                    MIXTAPE 03
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="mixtape-info">

                <h3>
                    DJ LUCXY PARTY MIX
                </h3>

                <p>
                    The ultimate party mix from
                    DJ LUCXY.
                </p>

                <a
                    class="download"
                    href="music/party-mix.mp3"
                    download="DJ-LUCXY-Party-Mix.mp3">

                    ⬇ DOWNLOAD

                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



<!-- =========================
     SONGS
========================== -->

<section class="section">

    <div class="section-title">

        <span>DJ LUCXY MUSIC</span>

        <h2>Latest Songs</h2>

    </div>


    <div class="song-list">


        <!-- SONG 1 -->

        <div class="song">

            <div class="song-number">
                01
            </div>

            <div>

                <h4>
